  "goodToKnow": "Die Domäne is a domain or field: Das ist seine Domäne (that's his speciality), eine Männerdomäne (a male-dominated field). Historically, it was a state-owned estate (Staatsdomäne). For internet addresses, Germans mostly say die Domain, and .de is the world's most registered country-code domain after China's .cn. From Latin dominus (lord). Plural: die Domänen."
